<title>ISRAEL: Dead Sea Q2 EPS 0.15 shekel vs 0.11.</title>
<headline>Dead Sea Q2 EPS 0.15 shekel vs 0.11.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Dead Sea Works Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>			   Q2 97    Q2 96	6-MTH 97    6-MTH 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  422,871  299,184    787,135     607,050</p>
<p>Pretax Profit	   75,593   51,423    140,001     109,794</p>
<p>Net Profit		43,220   32,581     83,083	70,506</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share</p>
<p>  (Israeli cents)	 0.15     0.11	 0.29	  0.25</p>
<p>Analysts expected Q2 net income in 1997 to be 35 million shekels.</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
